" # abbreviations
" 
" ## helpers
" 
" `una ps` will erase the abbreviation ps
" `q:` (...yes in that order) shows ex cmd history & u can copy from it:)
" don't forget in ex-cmd mode <C-r>"<register here> pastes into the commandline.." don't forget in ex-cmd mode <C-r>"<register here> pastes into the commandline...." 
"
"
" ### Notability hacks
"
" These tidy the math convertion output, which is annoying,
" 
" '<,'>s/dfrac/frac/g
" '<,'>s/\\left)/)/g
" '<,'>s/\\right)/)/g
"
" ## latex
" 

" quality of life hacks

" ### brackets and braces

iab lrp \left( \right) <ESC>8<LEFT>i
iab lr( \left( \right) <ESC>8<LEFT>i
iab lra \left\| \right\| <ESC>8<LEFT>i
iab lrmid \left\| \right\| <ESC>8<LEFT>i
iab lrb \left[ \right] <ESC>8<LEFT>i
iab lr[ \left[ \right] <ESC>8<LEFT>i
iab lblock \[\] <ESC>2<LEFT>i
iab lset \{\} <ESC>2<LEFT>i

" ### document sections

iab algn \begin{align}<ESC>o<ESC>I\end{align}<ESC>O
iab algnnum \begin{align*}<ESC>o<ESC>I\end{align*}<ESC>O
" iab algn \begin{align}<ESC>4o<ESC>I\end{align}<ESC>o<ESC>3kI

" iab tabb \begin{tabular}<ESC>o<ESC>I\end{tabular}{|c|c|}<ESC>O\hline<ESC>o
iab tabb \begin{tabular}<ESC>o<ESC>I\end{tabular}{\|c\|c\|}<ESC>O\hline<ESC>o
iab itemm \begin{itemize}<ESC>o<ESC>I\end{itemize}<ESC>O\item
iab enumm \begin{enumerate}<ESC>o<ESC>I\end{enumerate}<ESC>O\item
iab quoth \begin{quote}<ESC>o<ESC>I\end{quote}<ESC>O
iab prooff \begin{proof}<ESC>o<ESC>I\end{proof}<ESC>O
iab lemm \begin{lem}<ESC>o<ESC>I\end{lem}<ESC>O
iab ccase \begin{case}<ESC>o<ESC>I\end{case}<ESC>O
iab lfootnote \footnote{}<ESC>i

" ### document miscellany

iab hfill <ESC>o\hfill<CR>
iab ltext \text{}<ESC>i

" ### fractions

iab tfrac \tfrac{}{} <ESC>3<LEFT>i
iab frac \frac{}{} <ESC>3<LEFT>i
iab dfrac \dtrac{}{} <ESC>3<LEFT>i

" ### operations

iab sqrt \sqrt{}<ESC>i
iab cdot \cdot
iab XX \times
iab lsim \sim
iab lequiv \equiv

" ### trig

iab sin \sin{} <ESC>1<LEFT>i
iab cos \cos{} <ESC>1<LEFT>i
iab tan \tan{} <ESC>1<LEFT>i

" ### limits

iab lim \lim_{}{} <ESC>3<LEFT>i

" ### differentiation

iab ddx \tfrac{d}{dx}
iab dydx \tfrac{dy}{dx}

iab pi \pi

" ### logic operators

iab rarrow \rightarrow
iab larrow \leftarrow
iab lrarrow \leftrightarrow
iab limplies \implies

iab lwedge \wedge
iab lvee \vee
iab lneg \neg
 
iab lforall \forall
iab lnforall \nforall
iab lexists \exists
iab lnexists \nexists

" ### sets

iab lmid \mid

iab srn \mathbb{R}
iab snn \mathbb{N}
iab sin \mathbb{Z}
iab sqn \mathbb{Q}

iab lcup \cup
iab lcap \cap
iab lbigcup \bigcup
iab lbigcap \bigcap

iab sseteq \subseteq
iab sset \subset

iab lempty \emptyset

iab lmathcal \mathcal{}<ESC>i

" ### text formatting

iab ital \textit{}<ESC>i
iab bold \textbf{}<ESC>i
iab uline \underline{}<ESC>i
